    {
      "source": "README.md",
      "display": true,
      "tex": "\n\\mathcal O_\\perp[X] = f_\\perp\\left(\\mathcal K_d[X]-X\\right),\n\\qquad\nX_{\\mathrm{aug}}=(1-f_\\perp)X+f_\\perp\\mathcal K_d[X].\n"
