      "source": "docs/CONCEPTUAL_ORIGIN.md",
      "display": true,
      "tex": "\nX_{\\mathrm{aug}}\n=\nX+\\mathcal O_\\perp[X]\n=\n(1-f_\\perp)X+f_\\perp\\mathcal K_d[X].\n"
    },
    {
      "source": "docs/OPERATOR.md",
      "display": true,
      "tex": "\n\\mathcal O_\\perp[X] = f_\\perp\\big(\\mathcal K_d[X]-X\\big),\n"
